      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STEADY DREAM (3) could only manage to finish seventh at her latest appearance over 2240m at this track, a poor reflection on her short quote. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Meets some strong opposition this time but she has the ability to test this field. AT THE DISTANCE (5) was in the money two runs ago then went well again last time over 2080m at Cranbourne, finishing 2 metres from the winner in second. Must raise the bar but a big run is on the cards. MAJESTIC CHARMA (10) won two starts ago then things went wrong last start when she broke and finished a distant last over 2200m at Ballarat. Will need an ounce of luck to slot in from this tricky draw. Live chance in a similar assignment. ARZALI (4) is in the mix following a fourth at his most recent appearance over 2240m at this track.",
